{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nRe(log(x + i*y)) = log(x^2 + y^2)/2\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "re", "ucas": "re log(z)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "re", "input": "log(x + i*y)", "result": "log(x^2 + y^2)/2"}, "notes": [{"kind": "assumed", "text": "z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)"}, {"kind": "info", "text": "z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)"}, {"kind": "rule", "text": "i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.069800479105099e-16, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nRe(log(x + i*y)) = log(x^2 + y^2)/2\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nIm(log(x + i*y)) = atan2(y, x)\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "im", "ucas": "im log(z)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "im", "input": "log(x + i*y)", "result": "atan2(y, x)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "assumed", "text": "z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)"}, {"kind": "info", "text": "z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)"}, {"kind": "rule", "text": "i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nIm(log(x + i*y)) = atan2(y, x)\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n"}, "isError": false}}
