{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nIm(sqrt(x + i*y)) = copysign(sqrt((sqrt(x^2 + y^2) - x)/2), y)\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-15)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "im", "ucas": "im sqrt(z)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "im", "input": "sqrt(x + i*y)", "result": "copysign(sqrt((sqrt(x^2 + y^2) - x)/2), y)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "assumed", "text": "z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)"}, {"kind": "info", "text": "z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)"}, {"kind": "rule", "text": "i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 1.392982951209376e-15, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: z is taken as complex (no x or y here; say z: real for a real variable)\n  note: z = x + iy (real and imaginary parts real)\n  note: i is the imaginary unit; x, y are taken as real\nIm(sqrt(x + i*y)) = copysign(sqrt((sqrt(x^2 + y^2) - x)/2), y)\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-15)\n"}, "isError": false}}
